<title>USA: Advanced Voice faces shareholder lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Advanced Voice faces shareholder lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Voice Technologies Inc said on Thursday a purported class action suit had been filed against it and a director in a New York state court.</p>
<p>The lawsuit alleged certain violations of U.S. securities law in connection with the company's initial public stock offering in February 1995. The company said it believed it had no liability for the claims asserted against it in the lawsuit and it intended to defend itself vigorously.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
